AT chicken bit for the verilog-pcie example design (applied by the Makefile to
copies of the upstream files in obj_dir_vpcie/rtl/, see verilog-pcie-demo.md).

DMA descriptor tag bit 8 selects the AT field of the DMA engine's TLPs:
set (e.g. tag 0x1AA): virtual address, untranslated request (AT = 00),
clear (e.g. tag 0xAA): physical address, translated request (AT = 10).

